lified equation considering the total cost calculation is:\n\\[ 22.44 = 32.20 - C - A \\]\nWe need to find \\(A\\):\n\\[ 32.20 - (22.44 + C) + A = 32.20 \\]\n\\[ 32.20 - 22.44 = C + A \\]\nSimplifying this, we get:\n\\[ C + A = 9.76 \\]\nWe know the total cost calculation including tax:\n\\[ C + A + 0.08(C + A) = 24.20 \\]\n\\[ C + A + 0.08 \\cdot 9.76 = 24.20 \\]\n\\[ C + A + 0.7808 = 24.20 \\]\n\\[ C + A = 24.20 - ",
